WEBVTT

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:41.970
<i>Where... Where am I?</i>

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:54.750
<i>Another "me"...</i>

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:56.990
<i>A meta-body.</i>

00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:09.630
This is goodbye.

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:13.200
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:25.810
<i>Die?!</i>

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:30.020
<i>I'm going to die?!</i>

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:53.950
I guess that here, I'm that other guy.

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:57.790
Why do I feel so nihilistic?

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:59.380
You're at a transition point.

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:04.060
Shouldn't you be able to make it through this?

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:14.700
It's happening all over again.
Like just before he self-destructed.

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:17.640
He's struggling. Almost desperately.

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:19.700
In the boundary between reality and fiction.

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:22.840
He doesn't really want to kill himself, though.

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:25.780
Commander Shima.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:30.210
It's Kyo Sogoru.

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:33.120
He was once a comrade I could trust.

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:36.050
I'm hesitant to say this, but...

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.920
But we don't know how long we
can make use of the Hraesvelg.

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:42.400
So, what you're saying is
that the time has come.

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.470
To decide whether or not Kyo
Sogoru will be of any use to us?

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:48.970
When a nail gets bent,
you hammer it straight.

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:51.870
Some cures call for harsh treatment.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.030
If you have a proposal, I'm listening.

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:02.390
Forgive me, Chris.

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:05.180
Don't I keep saying you have
nothing to apologize for?

00:04:05.790 --> 00:04:08.360
Can't you acknowledge my feelings anyway?

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:11.920
Sure. I'll keep on acknowledging
them, just like I'm doing now.

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:15.070
You mind if I bother you for a bit?

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:17.300
No problem.
You're Kyo Sogoru, right?

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:18.870
Do we know each other?

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:21.510
Once we did, not so long ago.

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:22.910
I don't know about that.

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:24.460
You've forgotten?

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:26.780
I wanted to check out the Zega up close.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:31.380
It's our only life support system, isn't it?

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:34.610
We're only truly alive when
we're piloting these things.

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.520
You want to feel like you're really alive?

00:04:37.050 --> 00:04:38.560
I dunno.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:41.120
If something will let me feel that,
then I want to try it.

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:42.630
That's all I was thinking.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:46.720
Well, that's a positive outlook,
compared with the old you, at least.

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:50.900
Forget it, it's an improvement.

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:54.770
However, the acceptance of all things
is accompanied by pain, as well.

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:57.510
Chris, everything begins with acceptance.

00:04:57.510 --> 00:04:59.640
Even love begins with that.

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:01.340
You're right, Arque.

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:06.150
Here we are on the Seine...

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:08.410
What are they, the lovers of Pont Neuf?

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:10.380
I see nothing!

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:15.560
So, his big, meaningful statement
is that "love" is the answer, huh?

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.860
Lonely?

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:26.230
Have I been feeling lonely?

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:37.040
It's necessary for you to now
accept reality as you did before.

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:40.010
"Reality?" What's real at this point?!

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:41.890
Go see for yourself!

00:05:41.890 --> 00:05:45.880
That's insane! The enemy still
has Maihama under surveillance!

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:49.250
You can't grab hold of something
without getting your hands dirty.

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:51.560
I'm assigning May-yu as your Wizard.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.190
Just like you wanted, right, May-yu?

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:56.890
Of course.

00:05:57.840 --> 00:05:59.370
<i>Initiating countdown.</i>

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:01.840
<i>Transmission scatter rate, confirmed.</i>
<i>Compensating.</i>

00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:04.470
<i>Gunner! Wizard! Initiating transmission!</i>

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:06.740
<i>Confirming release of chamber shield.</i>

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:08.880
<i>Q.L. driver, conjunction!</i>

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:11.370
<i>Quantum teleportation core, systems go!</i>

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:16.620
The grief and pain you feel for something lost...

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:19.460
The best person to make him
understand those feelings...

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:21.480
is someone who knows
the grief of losing their own home.

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:25.220
<i>Transmission scatter rate, green!</i>

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:27.120
Moving to transmission chamber!

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:31.130
<i>Shift to Cerebrant mode!</i>

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:32.000
Acknowledged.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:35.240
<i>C.P.W., linked with May-yu!</i>

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:37.210
<i>H.P.G., linked with Kyo!</i>

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:38.910
<i>Systems check!</i>

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.470
<i>All systems, go!</i>

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:47.710
And here we are.
Now, if he makes it through this,

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:51.680
Kyo Sogoru may well
see the birth of a new self.

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:54.120
I hope it works out that well.

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:56.490
We have to risk it, in either case.

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:58.430
<i>Scanning, complete!</i>

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:00.860
<i>Compensating for materialization flux.</i>

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:02.900
<i>Reconstruction coordinates, set and locked!</i>

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.300
<i>Releasing hangar lock!</i>

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:07.840
<i>Zegapain, transmitting!</i>

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:08.860
Entangle!

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:21.450
Where are we?

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:23.490
Maihama in the real world.

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:27.510
It looks different from the
Maihama you know, doesn't it?

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:32.030
Not that shocking,
considering I saw it already.

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:34.890
Let's fly.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.160
There's no canal!

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:56.050
Hmpf! It's all falling apart now.

00:07:56.050 --> 00:07:58.780
Even that huge hole is empty now.

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:02.020
Do you enjoy saying that to me?!

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:06.220
Isn't that how you talked when the
Shanghai server was destroyed?

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:10.790
You don't feel any pain
unless it affects you directly?

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:16.940
Okay, so we failed on this round.

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:19.880
But channel how upset you are into the next game.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:22.340
We'll get our revenge on them then!

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:27.110
You mean, the Shanghai server was?

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:29.750
Yeah. It was my home.

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:32.390
I didn't know anything about it that time.

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:34.620
What's the point of apologizing to you?

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:38.490
Because reality is a lot harsher
than you think it is!

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:42.500
Where are we going?

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.990
To someplace you need to see.

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:51.040
There's no building like this in my Maihama!

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:14.360
Your target is beneath this facility.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:17.090
And how do you propose I get there?!

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:20.030
If I move away from the Zega, I'll disappear!

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:24.360
That's true. If you move beyond the
holographic projector's range, you'll vanish.

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:26.340
Quit humoring me!

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:30.980
If the data control server section is still
operating, we can transfer your data into it.

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:31.880
Transfer?

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:34.480
Naturally, I already have the
commander's permission to do that.

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:36.580
Okay, see you later!

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:41.590
Where the hell am I?!

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:44.320
It's essentially the same
structure as the Shanghai server.

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:54.290
<i>Where am I?</i>
<i>And what am I looking for in here?</i>

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:56.870
Just keep walking straight.

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:04.780
I can't touch you, can I?

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:13.820
No, don't close your eyes!
This is reality!

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:16.860
<i>See anyone familiar down there?</i>

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:17.880
Stop it!

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:30.130
<i>That's the world that, until</i>
<i>yesterday, you believed was real.</i>

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:33.030
"Mai... hama."

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:35.940
This... This can't be! It's!

00:10:36.350 --> 00:10:38.880
<i>Yes. It's the Maihama server.</i>

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:40.820
<i>That's where it's maintained.</i>

00:10:41.020 --> 00:10:44.480
<i>Containing you and the data</i>
<i>of the world you live in.</i>

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:46.410
Is this some kind of bad joke?

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:49.030
Inside this stupid box is?!

00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:50.660
<i>At least yours is still here!</i>

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:53.990
<i>There's nothing left of Shanghai server,</i>
<i>where we came from!</i>

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:57.460
Tell me you're kidding...

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:03.340
Not just me, but Kaminagi and Tomigai and
Kurage and everyone are in this thing?

00:11:03.340 --> 00:11:04.880
<i>It's true.</i>

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:07.570
It's true! That's why it's so important!

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:16.250
So, how was it?
How'd it feel to see reality?

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:17.650
Just shut up.

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:19.750
You still don't believe it?

00:11:20.090 --> 00:11:22.230
Want to destroy it and see for sure?

00:11:22.230 --> 00:11:25.160
Your city and your friends will just disappear.

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:27.350
Are you kidding?!

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:29.720
ARE YOU KIDDING ME?!

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:34.670
<i>Gunner has initiated transmission override.</i>

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:36.510
Did I go too far?

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:38.440
<i>Wizard, please return to ship as well.</i>

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:40.680
Roger... Hold it!

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:44.250
The enemy!

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:55.460
Gornes, closing range! Counting eight... Wait!

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:58.260
There are two squadrons!
There are eight more behind them!

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:02.430
What are you doing, Kyo?!
Leaving May-yu alone like that!

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.000
To hell with her!

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:06.100
To hell with all of this!

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:07.670
I don't believe it!

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:08.930
May-yu...

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:17.580
If I fight here,
I'll endanger the Maihama server!

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:28.050
Kyo!

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:32.630
Retreating into the box, huh?

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:35.160
No, I anticipated this as well.

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:38.300
Gornes are essentially cleric-types.

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:40.360
You don't suppose they're after
the Maihama server, do you?

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:41.130
Negative!

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:45.700
The improved armor and high-output beam
weaponry suggests they're a combat variant!

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:47.370
May-yu doesn't stand a chance against them!

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:48.950
What about my Zega?!

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:51.740
The Garuda is still being prepped for launch.

00:12:52.820 --> 00:12:54.880
Hraesvelg, launching!

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:57.850
Launch cruise missiles!
Try to distract the enemy!

00:12:57.850 --> 00:12:58.550
Aye, sir!

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.530
Gornes, engaging missiles!

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:07.730
Oceanus! Ahead, one-half!

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:10.930
Keep us moving till the Hraesvelg
is in transmission range!

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:12.740
They'll target our ship, as well.

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:14.230
That was anticipated as well.

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:17.600
I see. You were ready for all of this.

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:28.180
What should I do?

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:36.960
Mm, it's really good!

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:38.930
I'm glad you like it.

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:41.060
You're gonna make someone a great wife!

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:43.770
Well, that depends on whether
my cooking's to their taste or not.

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:46.400
Well, it's certainly to <i>my</i> taste!

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:47.270
Oh...

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.630
Ah, you're finally awake!

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:53.770
Slight anemia... That's not like you!

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:56.310
Um, why don't I leave you two alone?

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:57.340
Um...

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:03.250
For God's sake!
What do you think you're doing?!

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:07.460
Sorry. We're not really supposed to
act like that in front of the students.

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:09.760
That's not what I'm talking about!

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:12.600
Hm? What's got you so upset?

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:14.630
Want some of my lunch?

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:17.620
I mean cut it out with all this crap!

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:21.670
Oh, and having affection for
someone is "crap" to you?!

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:24.110
Haven't you ever cared about someone?!

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:37.280
Hey! I wanted to hear
about your love life, Sogoru!

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:43.930
<i>Nobody understands!</i>

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:46.830
<i>What's the point of falling in love</i>
<i>when you're not alive anymore?!</i>

00:14:58.340 --> 00:14:59.310
Ow...

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:00.470
Kyo!

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:02.940
What's with you?

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:05.180
What?!

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:07.120
Well, with the swim club.

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:10.680
Oh, to hell with that!
The swim club doesn't matter anymore!

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:15.460
You can't mean that.
Not after I finally want to swim again.

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:22.590
I mean, this whole deal with all of us
being so stubborn has gotten lame.

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:31.070
Transmission, complete.

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:35.410
But I'm reading severe meta-body
damage on Arque, your Wizard.

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:39.870
D-level, down 18. W-level, down 26.

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:54.690
I have to lead them away from the Maihama server!

00:15:57.300 --> 00:16:00.760
<i>There's nothing I can say to him.</i>

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:18.720
That armor! I can't shoot
them down from long range!

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:20.880
Give me the holonic blades!

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:27.620
The ocean is so beautiful, Chris...

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.160
Arque!

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:32.790
Sorry! I'm okay, now!

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:35.030
Blades, right hand!

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:45.710
Gornes, approaching ship!

00:16:47.550 --> 00:16:51.380
We don't have the firepower!
Let me force Kyo Sogoru to transfer back!

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:53.950
If he doesn't do it willingly,
it'll be meaningless!

00:16:54.460 --> 00:16:55.950
Hold on!

00:16:56.630 --> 00:17:02.460
I mean, it was like putting a positive spin on not
doing what I want to do, the way you're doing now.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.400
Are you listening?!

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:08.130
This is harder to say than
admitting you love somebody!

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:21.010
Kaminagi...

00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:29.090
<i>Warm, just as it always is.</i>

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:31.730
K- Kyo, hold on a second...

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.490
You're warm, Kaminagi.

00:17:34.730 --> 00:17:37.000
You're alive, aren't you?

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:41.100
<i>You are, aren't you, Kaminagi?</i>

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:43.400
<i>The way Chris and Arque are alive.</i>

00:17:43.970 --> 00:17:45.770
<i>The way Kurage and Omizu are alive...</i>

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:48.910
<i>Want to destroy it and see for sure?</i>

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:51.240
<i>Your city and your friends will just disappear.</i>

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:53.640
<i>Even May-yu...</i>

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:55.550
<i>Despite being a meta-body,</i>
<i>despite everything!</i>

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:00.890
That hurt!

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:02.820
Snap out of it, Kyo!

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:08.290
That's right! If I feel pain,
that means my mind exists to realize it!

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:10.460
Hayase! You exist, too!

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:12.760
What's brought that up?

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:15.840
If you exist,
then I must exist too, right?!

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:17.070
Meaning?

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:20.240
It means we're alive, doesn't it?!

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:22.130
What are you talking about?!

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:24.650
<i>It doesn't matter if I'm just a meta-body!</i>

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:28.350
Kyo!

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:31.340
You're back. Well?
Do you have your answer?

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:35.320
I'm alive. We're <i>all</i> alive!

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:38.460
<i>Zegapain Garuda, preflight, complete!</i>

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:40.260
Took long enough!

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:50.500
I'll take the point!

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:05.610
Would you lay off me?! You pests!

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:09.090
Sorry I kept you waiting!

00:19:09.090 --> 00:19:10.680
Wh-What's with you?

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:14.590
Pain comes with realization.
I'm sorry. That's all!

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:20.460
Holonic blade, deploying! Right hand!

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:27.080
You guys aren't going to
damage this place any more!

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:29.750
We're low on Q.L.! Time limit: two minutes!

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:30.640
PLENTY OF TIME!

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:39.960
Look at that. It's pretty, isn't it?

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:42.030
There's still life in this ocean.

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:44.790
Then I'll fight 'em for the ocean's sake, too!

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:51.260
There's still fish alive down there?

00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:55.590
Gornes, closing!

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:57.440
Gimme the launcher on the left hand!

00:19:57.440 --> 00:20:01.310
Forget it! If they shut their armor, even a hit
on their flight systems will have no effect!

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:02.300
Just deploy it!

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:09.180
Wh-What are you?!

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:10.750
I gotcha!

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:17.020
Hope you enjoy becoming a reef!

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:23.670
Interesting tactic. I'll use it.

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:25.690
<i>I won't even charge you a royalty!</i>

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:42.350
It's been a while since I've
enjoyed a fight this much.

00:20:42.350 --> 00:20:44.020
Are you enjoying it too, Dear?

00:20:44.020 --> 00:20:44.780
Yeah!

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:53.500
It seems he's accepted everything.

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:55.160
He's only blocking it.

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:57.260
It still remains to be seen...

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:59.970
if he'll keep up his struggle
when he learns of our true pain.

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:02.840
Isn't that right?

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:04.470
Perhaps.

00:22:51.380 --> 00:22:53.120
I'm feeling great now!

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:55.550
Looks like I'm going to manage to
get members for the swim club,

00:22:55.550 --> 00:22:57.750
and I'll be able to make up with Kaminagi!

00:22:57.750 --> 00:23:00.750
Just leave the next mission to me!

00:23:00.990 --> 00:23:04.490
Huh? Why are Chris and
Arque going to Maihama?

00:23:04.490 --> 00:23:09.170
Seriously? I had no idea they
were hiding a secret like that.

00:23:09.170 --> 00:23:10.330
But...

00:23:10.330 --> 00:23:13.170
THIS IS LAST THING I NEED RIGHT NOW!

00:23:13.170 --> 00:23:16.230
Next time, on Zegapain: "Wet Damage."

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:18.510
My thoughts, never to be erased.
